          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-amber-300 font-serif-sc text-xs">
            <span>🎯</span>
            <span>${isEn ? '4. Pareto 80/20 Executive Direct Takeaway (Lifelong Playbook)' : '四、二八实战定论 · 命主终身攻防锦囊 (一句话定乾坤)'}</span>
          </div>
